② Scene objects: Japanese street-corner convenience store, fully equipped with automatic sliding doors, canopy awning, vending machines, bicycles, and umbrella racks;
③ Interior details: Warm interior lighting, bento shelves, beverage refrigerated display cabinets, checkout counter, and oden cooking station, fully visible through the glass windows;
